{"meta":{"id":"lifecycle","category":"it/syntax/java/servlet","title":"서블릿 생명주기 (실행 순서) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"web.xml → 객체 생성 → @PostConstruct → init → Filter → service → doGet/doPost → destroy → @PreDestroy","tags":["java","f-lifecycle","f-config"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">서블릿 생명주기 (실행 순서) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> web.xml → 객체 생성 → @PostConstruct → init → Filter → service → doGet/doPost → destroy → @PreDestroy</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">서블릿 실행 순서</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">순서</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">단계</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">web.xml 읽기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서블릿 · 필터 · 리스너 설정 확인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서블릿 객체 생성 (최초 1회)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">&lt;listener&gt; / load-on-startup 이 있으면 서버 시작 시 미리 생성</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">@PostConstruct (최초 1회)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">선처리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">init() (최초 1회)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초기화</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Filter (매 요청)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">servlet.Filter — 인코딩, 로그인 확인 등</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">service() (매 요청)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">요청 방식에 따라 doGet() / doPost() 호출</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">7</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">doGet() / doPost()</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실제 처리. doPost 에서 doGet 을 호출해 한 곳에서 처리하기도 함</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">8</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">destroy() (마지막 1회)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 종료 · 재배포 시</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">9</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">@PreDestroy (마지막 1회)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">후처리</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기본 형태</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@WebServlet(&quot;/hello&quot;)\r\npublic class HelloServlet extends HttpServlet {\r\n    @Override public void init() { }                       // 최초 1회\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    protected void doGet(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)\r\n            throws ServletException, IOException {\r\n        request.setCharacterEncoding(&quot;UTF-8&quot;);\r\n        String name = request.getParameter(&quot;name&quot;);\r\n        request.setAttribute(&quot;name&quot;, name);\r\n        request.getRequestDispatcher(&quot;/WEB-INF/views/hello.jsp&quot;).forward(request, response);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    protected void doPost(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)\r\n            throws ServletException, IOException {\r\n        doGet(request, response);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Override public void destroy() { }                    // 마지막 1회\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Spring › web.xml (DispatcherServlet), Spring › 인터셉터</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet/lifecycle","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"servlet","title":"서블릿 (웹)","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet"}],"hasImage":false}